We want to be able to specify a list in a more lucid form when we are assigning it in a property.

For example, we want to be able to write:

.   x <- []
.      1
.      2
.      3

And this is then equivalent to:

.   x <- [1,2,3]

(Yes, I know that the latter is clearer when we are using small numbers, but the idea is to handle complex expressions well).

	target proplist
		ensure test.S3.Bucket "org.ziniki.launch_bucket"
			@teardown preserve
			contents <- []
				"this is a file"
				"this is something else"